# Messages for analytics.pageviews: a firehose. No keys and no headers, which is why every
# record lands on a partition round-robin and the topic spreads evenly across all twelve.
#
# The payloads are the same shape as each other but not identical: roughly one in five
# carries an A/B experiment block, one in four a viewport, and a few an explicit null. That
# is what a real event stream looks like once a product team has been shipping for a year,
# and it is what makes a JSON viewer worth having.
#mode: value-only

